{"id":"9bc70ef4e5fb062e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/070_超归结_Hyperresolution.md","title":"070 超归结 Hyperresolution","display":"070_超归结_Hyperresolution","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-子句签名\">1. 子句签名</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\">\\(Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var,fun,rel,pos,neg\">\\(var,fun,rel,pos,neg\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>目标差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{HR}=(Rule_{PHR},Rule_{NHR})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{HR}=(Rule_{PHR},Rule_{NHR})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中单步规则一次消去主子句中的多个同极性互补目标，并区分正超归结与负超归结。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、原子、文字与子句\">2. 项、原子、文字与子句</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F(f)=n\">\\(ar_F(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"At_\\Sigma\">\\(At_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in Rel\">\\(R\\in Rel\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R(R)=n\">\\(ar_R(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)\\in At_\\Sigma\">\\(rel(R,\\tau)\\in At_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>文字集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in At_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in At_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pos(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(pos(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in At_\\Sigma\">\\(P\\in At_\\Sigma\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(neg(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>子句集合与局部多重集代数定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Cl_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{C:Lit_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{supp}(C)=\\{L:C(L)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Cl_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{C:Lit_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{supp}(C)=\\{L:C(L)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L\\in_m C\\Longleftrightarrow C(L)&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\Box(L)=0,\n\\qquad\n[L](K)=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;K=L,\\\\0,&amp;K\\ne L,\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L\\in_m C\\Longleftrightarrow C(L)&gt;0,\n\\qquad\n\\Box(L)=0,\n\\qquad\n[L](K)=\\begin{cases}1,&amp;K=L,\\\\0,&amp;K\\ne L,\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\oplus D)(L)=C(L)+D(L),\n\\qquad\n|C|=\\sum_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}C(L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\oplus D)(L)=C(L)+D(L),\n\\qquad\n|C|=\\sum_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}C(L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:n\\to Lit_\\Sigma\">\\(e:n\\to Lit_\\Sigma\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mset}(e)(L)=|\\{i&lt;n:e(i)=L\\}|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mset}(e)(L)=|\\{i&lt;n:e(i)=L\\}|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C+D\">\\(C+D\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{L\\}\">\\(\\{L\\}\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\oplus D\">\\(C\\oplus D\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[L]\">\\([L]\\)</span>；以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{L_i:i&lt;n\\}\">\\(\\{L_i:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mset}(i\\mapsto L_i)\">\\(\\operatorname{mset}(i\\mapsto L_i)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>正文字谓词与负文字谓词为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"PosLit(pos(P)),\\qquad NegLit(neg(P)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[PosLit(pos(P)),\\qquad NegLit(neg(P)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与合一\">3. 自由变量、替换与合一</h1>\n<p>自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\n\\quad\nFV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_A(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_A(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_L(pos(P))=FV_A(P),\\qquad FV_L(neg(P))=FV_A(P),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_L(pos(P))=FV_A(P),\\qquad FV_L(neg(P))=FV_A(P),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_C(C)=\\bigcup_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}FV_L(L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_C(C)=\\bigcup_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}FV_L(L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_\\Sigma=\\{\\theta:Var\\to Tm_\\Sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换作用由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var\">\\(var\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun\">\\(fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rel\">\\(rel\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"pos\">\\(pos\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg\">\\(neg\\)</span> 五个构造子的对应方程给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(x)\\theta=\\theta(x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fun(f,\\tau)\\theta=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)\\theta=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[rel(R,\\tau)\\theta=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"pos(P)\\theta=pos(P\\theta),\\qquad neg(P)\\theta=neg(P\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[pos(P)\\theta=pos(P\\theta),\\qquad neg(P)\\theta=neg(P\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子句替换定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(C\\theta)(K)\n=\n\\sum_{\\substack{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)\\\\L\\theta=K}}C(L)\n\\qquad(K\\in Lit_\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(C\\theta)(K)\n=\n\\sum_{\\substack{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)\\\\L\\theta=K}}C(L)\n\\qquad(K\\in Lit_\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>故子句替换在不同文字合并时累加重数。</p>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MGU_n((P_i)_{i&lt;n},(Q_i)_{i&lt;n},\\theta)\">\\(MGU_n((P_i)_{i&lt;n},(Q_i)_{i&lt;n},\\theta)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i&lt;n\\ P_i\\theta=Q_i\\theta\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i&lt;n\\ P_i\\theta=Q_i\\theta\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\eta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i&lt;n\\ P_i\\eta=Q_i\\eta\">\\(\\forall i&lt;n\\ P_i\\eta=Q_i\\eta\\)</span>，则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\rho\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span> 使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in Var\\ \\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in Var\\ \\eta(x)=(\\theta(x))\\rho.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>系统无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-变量分离\">4. 变量分离</h1>\n<p>定义有限支撑单射重命名集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x,y\\in Var\\,(\\rho(x)=\\rho(y)\\Rightarrow x=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ren_\\Sigma=\\{\\rho:Var\\to Var:\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\land\\{x:\\rho(x)\\ne x\\}\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bar\\rho(x)=var(\\rho(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ren_\\Sigma=\\{\\rho:Var\\to Var:\\operatorname{Inj}(\\rho)\\land\\{x:\\rho(x)\\ne x\\}\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}Var\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bar\\rho(x)=var(\\rho(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限子句族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C_i)_{i&lt;n}\">\\((C_i)_{i&lt;n}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Apart_n((C_i)_{i&lt;n},(C&#39;_i)_{i&lt;n})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho:n\\to Ren_\\Sigma\\\n\\left(\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ C&#39;_i=C_i\\bar\\rho(i)\n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\ FV_C(C&#39;_i)\\cap FV_C(C&#39;_j)=\\varnothing\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Apart_n((C_i)_{i&lt;n},(C&#39;_i)_{i&lt;n})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\rho:n\\to Ren_\\Sigma\\\n\\left(\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ C&#39;_i=C_i\\bar\\rho(i)\n\\land\n\\forall i&lt;j&lt;n\\ FV_C(C&#39;_i)\\cap FV_C(C&#39;_j)=\\varnothing\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义超归结前提元组关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PremTuple}_{HR}(p,n,N,(S_i)_{i&lt;n})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\n\\land p(0)=N\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ p(i+1)=S_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PremTuple}_{HR}(p,n,N,(S_i)_{i&lt;n})\n\\Longleftrightarrow\np:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\n\\land p(0)=N\n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ p(i+1)=S_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义变量分离元组证书</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SepTuple}_{HR}(p,p&#39;,\\rho)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k&gt;0\\,\n\\bigl(\np,p&#39;:k\\to Cl_\\Sigma\n\\land\\rho:k\\to Ren_\\Sigma\n\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ p&#39;(i)=p(i)\\bar\\rho(i)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\ FV_C(p&#39;(i))\\cap FV_C(p&#39;(j))=\\varnothing\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SepTuple}_{HR}(p,p&#39;,\\rho)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists k&gt;0\\,\n\\bigl(\np,p&#39;:k\\to Cl_\\Sigma\n\\land\\rho:k\\to Ren_\\Sigma\n\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ p&#39;(i)=p(i)\\bar\\rho(i)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;j&lt;k\\ FV_C(p&#39;(i))\\cap FV_C(p&#39;(j))=\\varnothing\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(R\\in Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:n\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(U:n\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\">\\(\\theta\\in Sub_\\Sigma\\)</span>，定义输出构造</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HyperOut}_{HR}(R,U,\\theta)\n=\n(R\\oplus U(0)\\oplus\\cdots\\oplus U(n-1))\\theta,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HyperOut}_{HR}(R,U,\\theta)\n=\n(R\\oplus U(0)\\oplus\\cdots\\oplus U(n-1))\\theta,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时空和为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-正超归结规则\">5. 正超归结规则</h1>\n<p>正超归结规则关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{PHR}\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Cl_\\Sigma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{PHR}\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Cl_\\Sigma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((p,E))\\in Rule_{PHR}\">\\(((p,E))\\in Rule_{PHR}\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、主子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>、卫星列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:n\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(S:n\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>、变量分离副本 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p&#39;:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(p&#39;:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>、重命名列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:n+1\\to Ren_\\Sigma\">\\(\\rho:n+1\\to Ren_\\Sigma\\)</span>、原子列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i,Q_i\">\\(P_i,Q_i\\)</span>、剩余正文字多重集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,U_i\">\\(R,U_i\\)</span> 与替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PremTuple}_{HR}(p,n,N,S),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SepTuple}_{HR}(p,p&#39;,\\rho),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PremTuple}_{HR}(p,n,N,S),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SepTuple}_{HR}(p,p&#39;,\\rho),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N&#39;=p&#39;(0)\">\\(N&#39;=p&#39;(0)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S&#39;_i=p&#39;(i+1)\">\\(S&#39;_i=p&#39;(i+1)\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Apart_n((N,S_0,\\ldots,S_{n-1}),(N&#39;,S&#39;_0,\\ldots,S&#39;_{n-1})),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Apart_n((N,S_0,\\ldots,S_{n-1}),(N&#39;,S&#39;_0,\\ldots,S&#39;_{n-1})),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N&#39;=R\\oplus\\operatorname{mset}(i\\mapsto neg(P_i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N&#39;=R\\oplus\\operatorname{mset}(i\\mapsto neg(P_i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S&#39;_i=U_i\\oplus[pos(Q_i)]\\quad(i&lt;n),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S&#39;_i=U_i\\oplus[pos(Q_i)]\\quad(i&lt;n),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(R)\\ PosLit(L),\n\\qquad \\forall i&lt;n\\ \\forall L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(U_i)\\ PosLit(L),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(R)\\ PosLit(L),\n\\qquad \\forall i&lt;n\\ \\forall L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(U_i)\\ PosLit(L),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"MGU_n((P_i)_{i&lt;n},(Q_i)_{i&lt;n},\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[MGU_n((P_i)_{i&lt;n},(Q_i)_{i&lt;n},\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E=\\operatorname{HyperOut}_{HR}(R,i\\mapsto U_i,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E=\\operatorname{HyperOut}_{HR}(R,i\\mapsto U_i,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>正超归结证书为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HRCert}^{+}(p,E,w)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HRCert}^{+}(p,E,w)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w=(n,N,S,p&#39;,\\rho,(P_i),(Q_i),R,(U_i),\\theta)\">\\(w=(n,N,S,p&#39;,\\rho,(P_i),(Q_i),R,(U_i),\\theta)\\)</span>，并要求上述每个等式、极性条件、分离条件与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"MGU_n\">\\(MGU_n\\)</span> 条件成立。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-负超归结规则\">6. 负超归结规则</h1>\n<p>负超归结规则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_{NHR}\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Cl_\\Sigma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_{NHR}\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\times Cl_\\Sigma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((p,E))\\in Rule_{NHR}\">\\(((p,E))\\in Rule_{NHR}\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、主子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span>、卫星列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S:n\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(S:n\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>、变量分离副本 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p&#39;:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(p&#39;:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>、重命名列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:n+1\\to Ren_\\Sigma\">\\(\\rho:n+1\\to Ren_\\Sigma\\)</span>、原子列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i,Q_i\">\\(P_i,Q_i\\)</span>、剩余负文字多重集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,U_i\">\\(R,U_i\\)</span> 与替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PremTuple}_{HR}(p,n,N,S),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SepTuple}_{HR}(p,p&#39;,\\rho),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PremTuple}_{HR}(p,n,N,S),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{SepTuple}_{HR}(p,p&#39;,\\rho),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N&#39;=p&#39;(0)\">\\(N&#39;=p&#39;(0)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S&#39;_i=p&#39;(i+1)\">\\(S&#39;_i=p&#39;(i+1)\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Apart_n((N,S_0,\\ldots,S_{n-1}),(N&#39;,S&#39;_0,\\ldots,S&#39;_{n-1})),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Apart_n((N,S_0,\\ldots,S_{n-1}),(N&#39;,S&#39;_0,\\ldots,S&#39;_{n-1})),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N&#39;=R\\oplus\\operatorname{mset}(i\\mapsto pos(P_i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N&#39;=R\\oplus\\operatorname{mset}(i\\mapsto pos(P_i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S&#39;_i=U_i\\oplus[neg(Q_i)]\\quad(i&lt;n),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S&#39;_i=U_i\\oplus[neg(Q_i)]\\quad(i&lt;n),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(R)\\ NegLit(L),\n\\qquad \\forall i&lt;n\\ \\forall L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(U_i)\\ NegLit(L),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(R)\\ NegLit(L),\n\\qquad \\forall i&lt;n\\ \\forall L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(U_i)\\ NegLit(L),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"MGU_n((P_i)_{i&lt;n},(Q_i)_{i&lt;n},\\theta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[MGU_n((P_i)_{i&lt;n},(Q_i)_{i&lt;n},\\theta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E=\\operatorname{HyperOut}_{HR}(R,i\\mapsto U_i,\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E=\\operatorname{HyperOut}_{HR}(R,i\\mapsto U_i,\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>负超归结证书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HRCert}^{-}(p,E,w)\">\\(\\operatorname{HRCert}^{-}(p,E,w)\\)</span> 使用同型见证元组，并要求本节全部负极性条件成立。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-超归结推导\">7. 超归结推导</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(S\\subseteq Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span> 出发的超归结推导是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C_0,\\ldots,C_{m-1})\">\\((C_0,\\ldots,C_{m-1})\\)</span>，每一行至少满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_i\\in S\">\\(C_i\\in S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、严格递增索引列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:n+1\\to i\">\\(j:n+1\\to i\\)</span> 与前提元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\">\\(p:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=C_{j(k)}\">\\(p(k)=C_{j(k)}\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n+1\">\\(k&lt;n+1\\)</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((p),C_i)\\in Rule_{PHR}\\cup Rule_{NHR}\">\\(((p),C_i)\\in Rule_{PHR}\\cup Rule_{NHR}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{HR}(S,\\Pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Pi(i)\\in S\n\\vee\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists j:n+1\\to i\\ \\exists p:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\,\n\\bigl(\n[\\forall k&lt;n+1\\ p(k)=\\Pi(j(k))]\n\\land ((p),\\Pi(i))\\in Rule_{PHR}\\cup Rule_{NHR}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LineOK}_{HR}(S,\\Pi,i)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Pi(i)\\in S\n\\vee\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists j:n+1\\to i\\ \\exists p:n+1\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\,\n\\bigl(\n[\\forall k&lt;n+1\\ p(k)=\\Pi(j(k))]\n\\land ((p),\\Pi(i))\\in Rule_{PHR}\\cup Rule_{NHR}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Der}_{HR}(S,\\Pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Der}_{HR}(S,\\Pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to Cl_\\Sigma\n\\wedge\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{HR}(S,\\Pi,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to Cl_\\Sigma\n\\wedge\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{HR}(S,\\Pi,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-推出与反驳\">8. 推出与反驳</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\vdash_{HR}C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{HR}(S,\\Pi)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{HR}(\\Pi,C)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\vdash_{HR}C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi\\,\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Der}_{HR}(S,\\Pi)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{HR}(\\Pi,C)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}_{HR}(\\Pi,C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\wedge \\Pi(m-1)=C\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Last}_{HR}(\\Pi,C)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(m&gt;0\\wedge \\Pi:m\\to Cl_\\Sigma\\wedge \\Pi(m-1)=C\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ref_{HR}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash_{HR}\\Box.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ref_{HR}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow S\\vdash_{HR}\\Box.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{HR}(S)=\\{C\\in Cl_\\Sigma:S\\vdash_{HR}C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{HR}(S)=\\{C\\in Cl_\\Sigma:S\\vdash_{HR}C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>目标区分对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{HR}\n=\n(Rule_{PHR},Rule_{NHR},\\operatorname{Der}_{HR},\\vdash_{HR},Ref_{HR}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{HR}\n=\n(Rule_{PHR},Rule_{NHR},\\operatorname{Der}_{HR},\\vdash_{HR},Ref_{HR}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Hyperresolution}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nAt_\\Sigma,\nLit_\\Sigma,\nCl_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{supp},\n\\in_m,\n\\Box,\n[-],\n\\oplus,\n|-|,\n\\operatorname{mset},\nPosLit,\nNegLit,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nRen_\\Sigma,\nMGU_n,\nApart_n,\n\\operatorname{PremTuple}_{HR},\n\\operatorname{SepTuple}_{HR},\n\\operatorname{HyperOut}_{HR},\nRule_{PHR},\nRule_{NHR},\n\\operatorname{HRCert}^{+},\n\\operatorname{HRCert}^{-},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{HR},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{HR},\n\\vdash_{HR},\nRef_{HR},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{HR},\n\\Delta_{HR}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Hyperresolution}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nVar,\nTm_\\Sigma,\nAt_\\Sigma,\nLit_\\Sigma,\nCl_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{supp},\n\\in_m,\n\\Box,\n[-],\n\\oplus,\n|-|,\n\\operatorname{mset},\nPosLit,\nNegLit,\nSub_\\Sigma,\nRen_\\Sigma,\nMGU_n,\nApart_n,\n\\operatorname{PremTuple}_{HR},\n\\operatorname{SepTuple}_{HR},\n\\operatorname{HyperOut}_{HR},\nRule_{PHR},\nRule_{NHR},\n\\operatorname{HRCert}^{+},\n\\operatorname{HRCert}^{-},\n\\operatorname{Der}_{HR},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{HR},\n\\vdash_{HR},\nRef_{HR},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{HR},\n\\Delta_{HR}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含一次消去多个互补文字的正、负超归结规则；不含普通二元归结作为唯一基本规则或结构解释。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-子句签名","text":"1. 子句签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项、原子、文字与子句","text":"2. 项、原子、文字与子句","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与合一","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与合一","level":1},{"id":"4.-变量分离","text":"4. 变量分离","level":1},{"id":"5.-正超归结规则","text":"5. 正超归结规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-负超归结规则","text":"6. 负超归结规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-超归结推导","text":"7. 超归结推导","level":1},{"id":"8.-推出与反驳","text":"8. 推出与反驳","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)","display":false},{"tex":"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"var,fun,rel,pos,neg","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{HR}=(Rule_{PHR},Rule_{NHR})","display":true},{"tex":"Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Fun","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F(f)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in Rel","display":false},{"tex":"ar_R(R)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"rel(R,\\tau)\\in At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"Lit_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"pos(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in At_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"neg(P)\\in Lit_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"Cl_\\Sigma\n=\n\\{C:Lit_\\Sigma\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{supp}(C)=\\{L:C(L)>0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"L\\in_m C\\Longleftrightarrow C(L)>0,\n\\qquad\n\\Box(L)=0,\n\\qquad\n[L](K)=\\begin{cases}1,&K=L,\\\\0,&K\\ne L,\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"(C\\oplus D)(L)=C(L)+D(L),\n\\qquad\n|C|=\\sum_{L\\in\\operatorname{supp}(C)}C(L).","display":true},{"tex":"e:n\\to Lit_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{mset